---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact Darko Tushev | AI Strategy & Product" description="Reach out to me for mentorship, non-profit advice, or just to talk dogs.">
	<section class="py-16 md:py-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
		
		<h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[#18181B] dark:text-[#F4F4F5] mb-6">
			Let's Talk ☕
		</h1>
		
		<p class="text-xl text-[#52525B] dark:text-[#A1A1AA] leading-relaxed mb-12">
			I believe in making time for people and ideas that matter. Whether you’re a nonprofit exploring how AI could further your mission, someone looking for mentorship, or a leader working at the intersection of AI, product, commerce, and customer experience, my door is open.
		</p>

		<div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#09090B] border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm mb-12">
			<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#18181B] dark:text-[#F4F4F5] mb-4">How to reach me</h2>
			<p class="text-[#52525B] dark:text-[#A1A1AA] mb-8">
LinkedIn is the best way to reach me. I read every genuine message and always enjoy connecting with thoughtful people building, learning, or trying to make something better.			</p>
			
			<div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
				<a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-medium py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-colors">
					Message on LinkedIn
				</a>
				<a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank" class="w-full sm:w-auto bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 text-[#18181B] dark:text-[#F4F4F5] font-medium py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition-colors">
					Instagram
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-500 italic">
			<strong>A polite request:</strong> If you are reaching out just to pitch a product or make a quick buck, please save us both some time. I will not reply.
		</p>

	</section>
</Layout>